==History==
2025
*On 14/08/2025, the Vines was accidentally added into the game during a maintenance break along with the Baby Dragon Evolution, but were quickly removed afterwards. Players who had unlocked the card before it was removed would still be able to use it.
*On 1/9/2025, the Vines was added to the game in the September 2025 Update.
*On 5/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/9/2025)|Balance Update]] decreased total damage by 17%.
*On 8/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased duration to 2 seconds (from 2.5 seconds) and decreased total damage 9%.
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Vines deploy time to 0.9 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Vines' Crown Tower damage to 23% of its full damage (from 25%)

