==Trivia==
*In the German, Italian and Turkish language settings of the game, the Vines' name translates to "Tendrils", "Tangle", and "Ivy" respectively.
**In the Italian langauge settings of the game, the Vines name used to have a different name, which translated to "I'll Catch You", but it was changed in a later update.
*The mechanism is similar to the net thrown by the [[Hunter/Evolution|Evolved Hunter]] and the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Overgrowth_Spell Overgrowth Spell] from Clash of Clans.
*Before the Vines card was released, the Vines' damage was decreased by 7%.

